---@field outputState? gcp.billingbudgets_v1.GoogleCloudBillingBudgetsV1SpendCapOutputStateEnum|string Output only. The actual resting state of the spend cap.
---@field reconciling? boolean Output only. Indicates whether the server is actively processing a state transition or async workflow.
---@field inputState? gcp.billingbudgets_v1.GoogleCloudBillingBudgetsV1SpendCapInputStateEnum|string Required. The desired state specified by the user. Valid values for mutation: - `CONFIGURED`: Must be set when creating a spend cap (`CreateBudget`). Also valid when updating (`UpdateBudget`) to activate the spend cap. If the spend cap is in state `AWAITING_NEXT_PERIOD`, `input_state` must be set to `CONFIGURED`. - `AWAITING_NEXT_PERIOD`: Valid only when updating (`UpdateBudget`) to explicitly lift an enforced cap. Not allowed if the spend cap is in state `AWAITING_NEXT_PERIOD`. Supplying any other value will result in an INVALID_ARGUMENT error.

