---@field notificationsRule? gcp.billingbudgets_v1.GoogleCloudBillingBudgetsV1NotificationsRule Optional. Rules to apply to notifications sent based on budget spend and thresholds. Must be set when `spend_cap` is set. For spend caps, `enable_project_level_recipients` must be set to `true`, `disable_default_iam_recipients` must be `false` (or unset), and `pubsub_topic` and `monitoring_notification_channels` must be empty.
